We went over the major new additions for the future patch – from new quests and endings to revamped UIs and Quality of Life features. Now we cover some less visually enticing but still important aspects, mainly optimizations and some minor changes.
[list]
[*] faster processing for navigation and pathfinding;
[*] speech bubbles have been refactored to allow a few features;
[*] improved lip-syncing and text parsing;
[*] faster loading times for scenes;
[*] some minor lighting effects;
[*] and a handful of continuity fixes.
[/list]
[i]Did we remove the countdown?[/i] No, that one stays.
[i]Did we make the game more trolly?[/i] You bet we did!
[i]Did we fix some of the bugs at least?[/i] What's a [i]"bug"[/i]?

This will be the last post-DEV LOG for a while. The next will likely be the announcement of the release date for the v1.5 patch. Right now we are mostly finishing the missing parts, a bit of polishing and soon we'll enter the beta testing.

We might sporadically do smaller posts.

This patch fixes many small bugs and glitches that have been reported to us in [i]Nefasto's Misadventure: Meeting Noeroze[/i].

It includes fixes for:
[list][*] weird positioning and behaviour of characters;
[*] occasional wait-lags during boss fights when many events happen at once;
[*] missing hidden interactions;
[*] obscure continuity errors;
[*] a camera misplacement that can happen during END C;
[*] other visual glitches.
[/list]
One major one was some achievements and endings not being correctly saved. For the affected players, any missing ones will now be unlocked automatically at the start of the game.

Concerning a very specific issue... If you get a Game Over at the bird event during the second phase of the final boss, the key interaction point - for those who are in the know - is now reset correctly allowing for the True Ending to still be possible. This should alleviate some confusion for anyone playing that route and surprised they couldn't get the aforementioned ending.

If you encounter any bugs or problems of any kind during your game, you can report them to us at [url=https://discord.gg/dBRCzFgYQF]our official Discord Server[/url]

To finish this post, [b]we are working on [i]Update 1.50[/i][/b] with new added content like [b]new quests[/b], [b]Quality of Life features[/b], [b]new events[/b], and more... 

Hope to see you back on the game!
